290
00:12:49,750 --> 00:12:51,270
That's clear and professional.

291
00:12:51,270 --> 00:12:54,670
Tina, what about when you assign tasks to others?

292
00:12:54,670 --> 00:13:00,270
question, I try to be polite and clear. Can you give an example? Sure. I might say,

293
00:13:00,830 --> 00:13:05,150
