294
00:13:05,150 --> 00:13:09,550
That sounds polite. Yes, and I also explain the details clearly.

295
00:13:09,550 --> 00:13:13,710
That's important. Tina, what do you say when you finish all your tasks?

296
00:13:13,710 --> 00:13:17,390
I usually say, I've completed all my tasks for today.

297
00:13:17,390 --> 00:13:21,870
