298
00:13:21,870 --> 00:13:26,910
That's very helpful for the team. Tina, I noticed you're very organized with your tasks.

299
00:13:26,910 --> 00:13:29,870
Thank you. I try to plan everything in advance.

300
00:13:29,870 --> 00:13:32,110
Do you always follow your plan?

301
00:13:32,110 --> 00:13:35,710
Not always. Sometimes unexpected tasks come up.

302
00:13:35,710 --> 00:13:37,070
That happens to me too.

303
00:13:37,070 --> 00:13:39,870
When that happens, I adjust my priorities.

304
00:13:39,870 --> 00:13:41,230
That's a good strategy.

305
00:13:41,230 --> 00:13:44,110
Tina, what do you say when you make a mistake in a task?

306
00:13:44,110 --> 00:13:49,150
I try to be honest. I say, I made a mistake and I'm working on fixing it.

307
00:13:49,150 --> 00:13:50,350
That's responsible.

308
00:13:50,350 --> 00:13:54,110
Or, I apologize for the error. I will correct it immediately.

309
00:13:54,110 --> 00:13:58,190
That sounds very professional. Tina, how do you report your progress?

310
00:13:58,190 --> 00:14:02,830
I usually say, the task is in progress. Or, I'm halfway done.

311
00:14:02,830 --> 00:14:03,870
That's useful.

312
00:14:03,870 --> 00:14:07,710
Or, I've made good progress and expect to finish soon.

313
00:14:07,710 --> 00:14:11,630
I like that phrase. Tina, do you enjoy talking about your tasks?

314
00:14:11,630 --> 00:14:14,510
Yes, because it helps keep everyone informed.

315
00:14:14,510 --> 00:14:15,470
That's true.

316
00:14:15,470 --> 00:14:17,950
Good communication makes teamwork easier.

317
00:14:17,950 --> 00:14:20,910
I agree. Well, Tina, we covered a lot today.

318
00:14:20,910 --> 00:14:27,790
Yes, we talked about how to describe tasks, give updates, ask for help, and communicate clearly at work.

319
00:14:27,790 --> 00:14:30,350
These are essential skills for any job.

320
00:14:30,350 --> 00:14:34,510
Absolutely. And the more you practice, the more natural it will feel.

321
00:14:34,510 --> 00:14:37,310
So keep practicing these phrases every day.

322
00:14:37,310 --> 00:14:39,150
And don't be afraid to speak.

