00:14:39,150 --> 00:14:40,590
Thanks for listening, everyone.

324
00:14:40,590 --> 00:14:41,390
See you next time.

325
00:14:44,160 --> 00:14:48,240
Welcome, everyone. Let's begin today's English conversation.

