00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:32,740
conversation.

335
00:15:32,740 --> 00:15:37,000
Imagine you are in the office with us, listening and participating.

336
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:39,440
Alright. Are you ready?

337
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:40,440
Let's get started.

338
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:43,940
Hey, Sophia. Good morning. How are you today?

339
00:15:43,940 --> 00:15:49,260
Good morning, Daniel. I'm doing well, thanks. I actually started my day early today. I wanted

340
00:15:49,260 --> 00:15:53,020
