424
00:19:47,540 --> 00:19:50,460
And here I'm showing the data analysis.

425
00:19:50,460 --> 00:19:54,260
Maybe you can add a chart to make it more visual.

426
00:19:54,260 --> 00:19:56,380
Good suggestion. I'll add one.

427
00:19:56,380 --> 00:19:59,580
